msgid "Documentation for the latest version of Qiskit propagated noise absorption"
msgstr "Dokumentasi untuk versi terbaru Qiskit propagated noise absorption"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagated noise absorption (PNA)"
msgstr "Propagated noise absorption (PNA)"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagated noise absorption (PNA) {#propagated-noise-absorption-pna}"
msgstr "Propagated noise absorption (PNA) {#propagated-noise-absorption-pna}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package implements propagated noise absorption (PNA) [\\[1\\]](#references) for mitigating errors in the expectation value of observables.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini mengimplementasikan propagated noise absorption (PNA) [\\[1\\]](#references) untuk memitigasi error pada expectation value dari observable.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PNA works by “absorbing” the inverses of the learned noise channels into a target observable using Pauli propagation. That is, each Pauli noise generator in the noise model is classically propagated to the end of the circuit and applied to the observable. This results in a new observable that, when measured on a QPU, mitigates the learned gate noise.\n"
msgstr "PNA bekerja dengan \"menyerap\" invers dari noise channel yang telah dipelajari ke dalam observable target memakai Pauli propagation. Artinya, setiap generator noise Pauli di noise model dirambatkan secara klasik sampai akhir circuit dan diterapkan ke observable. Hasilnya adalah observable baru yang, saat diukur pada QPU, memitigasi noise gate yang telah dipelajari.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package is suitable for estimating expectation values of general quantum circuits and Pauli observables; however, the technique is generally most effective on circuits that are near-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini cocok untuk mengestimasi expectation value dari quantum circuit umum dan observable Pauli; namun, tekniknya umumnya paling efektif pada circuit yang hampir Clifford.\n"

